        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Hinduism</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1500 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Origin</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indian-subcontinent">Indian subcontinent</a>: the Vedic religion of the north-west from about 1500 BCE, with older and local traditions</span></div>
